{"id":"en_rescued-by-my-billionaire-first-love","title":"Rescued by my Billionaire first love","titleEn":"Rescued by my Billionaire first love","description":"Ella thought she had left her past behind, but a chance encounter brings Max Taylor—now a billionaire heir—back into her life. Both are caught in impossible situations: she is stuck in a violent engagement, while he faces family pressure to marry for convenience. Their rekindled feelings draw them into a battle against scheming relatives, hidden dangers, and determined enemies set on tearing them apart. With so much deception and so many painful decisions ahead, the question is whether their first love can endure. Viewers can follow this series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/rescued-by-my-billionaire-first-love/en_US/c69ae2d39bc7c269/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/rescued-by-my-billionaire-first-love/en_US/c69ae2d39bc7c269/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dijbw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_rescued-by-my-billionaire-first-love_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dijbw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_rescued-by-my-billionaire-first-love_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dijbw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_rescued-by-my-billionaire-first-love_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dijbw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_rescued-by-my-billionaire-first-love_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number